    <!-- Unstyled List -->
    <h2 class="sub-title">Unstyled List</h2>
    <p>Remove the default <span class="txt-class">list-style</span> and left margin on list items (immediate children only). This only applies to immediate children list items, meaning you will need to add the class for any nested lists as well.</p>
    <div class="docs-section">
        <div class="btn btn-primary btn-xs withripple view-source">&lt; Source &gt;</div>
        <div class="example-section">
            <h2>Example</h2>
            <div class="demo-section">
